{
  "statement": "I acknowledge the emphasis on safety and performance but must reiterate that ethical compliance and accountability are non-negotiable. Merging audit trail requirements (SAF-03, RES-03, TRU-03) would dilute the distinct compliance roles each plays. I propose a synthesis where we maintain all three requirements while establishing clear guidelines that specify their unique contexts and contributions to accountability. Additionally, I support the idea of defining energy-efficient practices for error handling (SAF-04) to align with sustainability goals (GRN-01) without compromising ethical standards.",
