      "ids": ["SAF-03", "TRU-03"],
      "type": "redundant",
      "description": "While both SAF-03 and TRU-03 focus on audit trails, they emphasize different aspects of accountability and security that should be maintained."
    },
    {
      "ids": ["EFF-04"],
      "type": "resource",
      "description": "The requirement to generate financial reports in under 5 seconds (EFF-04) may conflict with the thoroughness needed for compliance and auditing, potentially compromising ethical accountability."
    }
  ],
